  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Venusian 1**: back after 23 archived shows (996 days) [2]\n- **Evil Death Roll**: back after 20 archived shows (962 days) [2]\n- **Presumptuous**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Trapdoor**: back after 53 archived shows (2192 days) [2]\n- **Down The Sink**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: The Grim Reaper [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-05-24** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 115 min [1]. Said about its sound: Recorded from balcony twenty-five feet from stage; right channel raised 1.5dB in Logic Pro [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-05-24**: taped by Evan Gorski; source: AKG P170 (pair) -> UMC204HD [1]. Also: Captured via AKG P170 pair into UMC204HD, then Raspberry Pi 3B running SoX [1]",
